{%- comment -%}
  Puredeco · inspiratiepagina (blog 'nieuws', URL blijft /blogs/nieuws). Artboard: docs/ontwerp-puredeco-finish/InspiratieV3-*.png
  Echte wanden voorop: hero = projectvideo van een product (puredeco.project_video, stappen uit project_steps),
  blokken 'Wanden van klanten' (video of foto per blok, met decor), per ruimte zonder renders (staal van het decor),
  per materiaal, 'Van paneel tot wand' (echte montage- en buigvideo), advies, projecten en vragen.
  Gegevens per artikel/gids: snippets/pd-insp.liquid. Renders staan alleen nog in de gidsen.
  Gidslinks: bestaat het artikel 'wandpanelen-<ruimte>' in deze blog, dan daarheen; anders (alleen H1-test) naar ?view=gids-<ruimte>.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign insp_url = blog.url
  assign gids_bk_url = insp_url | append: '?view=gids-badkamer'
  assign gids_buig_url = insp_url | append: '?view=gids-buigen'
  assign guide_urls = ''
  for a in blog.articles limit: 50
    assign ah = a.handle | split: '/' | last
    if ah contains 'wandpanelen-'
      assign guide_urls = guide_urls | append: ah | append: '=' | append: a.url | append: '|'
    endif
    if ah == 'wandpanelen-badkamer'
      assign gids_bk_url = a.url
    endif
    if ah == 'wandpanelen-buigen'
      assign gids_buig_url = a.url
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    Laagste prijs per m² over alle wandpanelen, live uit de winkel.
  endcomment
  assign min_m2 = 0
  for p in collections['wandpanelen'].products limit: 60
    capture c
      render 'pd-m2', product: p, part: 'cents'
    endcapture
    assign c = c | strip | plus: 0
    if c > 0
      if min_m2 == 0 or c < min_m2
        assign min_m2 = c
      endif
    endif
  endfor

  assign rooms = 'badkamer,toilet,keuken,woonkamer,slaapkamer,kantoor' | split: ','
  assign room_name = 'Badkamer,Toilet,Keuken,Woonkamer,Slaapkamer,Kantoor' | split: ','
  assign room_ttl = 'Wandpanelen in de badkamer|Wandpanelen in het toilet|Wandpanelen in de keuken|Wandpanelen in de woonkamer|Wandpanelen in de slaapkamer|Wandpanelen op kantoor' | split: '|'
  assign room_sub = '851 Travertine Ivory · over de tegels|666 White Slate · vaak één paneel|670 Pandora Slate · keukenwand|811 Walnut Classic · tv-wand|812 Walnut Deep · achter het bed|619 Jade · met akupanelen' | split: '|'
  assign room_p = 'wandpaneel-travertine-ivory-851,666-glanzend-marmer-white-slate,670-glanzend-marmer-pandora-slate,811-hout-walnut-classic,812-hout-walnut-deep,619-japanse-stof-japaneses-style-jade' | split: ','

  comment
    Hero: projectvideo van het gekozen product
  endcomment
  assign hp = s.hero_product
  assign hv = hp.metafields.puredeco.project_video.value
  assign h_caption = hp.metafields.puredeco.project_caption.value
  assign h_note = hp.metafields.puredeco.project_note.value
  assign h_steps = hp.metafields.puredeco.project_steps.value | split: '|'
  capture h_code
    render 'pd-decor', product: hp, part: 'code'
  endcapture
  capture h_name
    render 'pd-decor', product: hp, part: 'name'
  endcapture
  assign h_label = h_code | strip | append: ' ' | append: h_name | strip
  assign h_v = hp.selected_or_first_available_variant
  capture h_swatch
    render 'pd-swatch', product: hp, width: 240
  endcapture
  if hv
    assign hv_hls = hv.sources | where: 'format', 'm3u8' | first
    assign hv_mp4 = hv.sources | where: 'format', 'mp4' | sort: 'height' | last
  endif
-%}

<div class="pdi pdi3" data-pdi3 data-max="5">
  <div class="pdi-wrap">
    <nav class="pdi-crumb" aria-label="Kruimelpad"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Inspiratie</span></nav>
  </div>

  <div class="pdi-wrap pdi3-top">
    <header class="pdi3-head">
      <p class="pdi-k">Inspiratie &amp; advies</p>
      <h1 class="pdi-h1">{{ s.heading | default: 'Wandpanelen voor elke ruimte' }}</h1>
      <p class="pdi3-intro">{{ s.intro | default: 'Echte wanden van klanten, per ruimte uitgelegd. Kies je decor en bestel gratis stalen.' }}</p>
      <ul class="pdi3-facts" role="list">
        <li>Panelen tot 280 cm hoog, 122 cm breed</li>
        {%- if min_m2 > 0 -%}<li>Vanaf {{ min_m2 | money }} per m²</li>{%- endif -%}
        <li><a href="/pages/sample">Tot 5 stalen gratis</a> · € 6,95 verzending</li>
        <li><a href="/pages/showroom">Studio Herwen</a> op afspraak</li>
      </ul>
      <nav class="pdi3-chips pdi3-chips--d" aria-label="Per ruimte">
        {%- for r in rooms -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign i = forloop.index0
            assign guide_key = '|wandpanelen-' | append: r | append: '='
            assign link = insp_url | append: '?view=gids-' | append: r
            assign gu = '|' | append: guide_urls
            if gu contains guide_key
              assign link = gu | split: guide_key | last | split: '|' | first
            endif
            assign rp = all_products[room_p[i]]
            capture sw
              render 'pd-swatch', product: rp, width: 80
            endcapture
          -%}
          <a class="pdi3-chip" href="{{ link }}">{% if rp %}<img src="{{ sw | strip }}" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{{ room_name[i] }}</a>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </nav>
    </header>

    {%- if hv -%}
      <div class="pdi3-film">
        <figure class="pdi3-hero pdi3-v" data-pdi3-hero>
          {{ hv.preview_image | image_url: width: 1080 | image_tag: widths: '540, 720, 900, 1080', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 38vw, 100vw', fetchpriority: 'high', loading: 'eager', alt: hv.alt, class: 'pdi3-v__poster' }}
          <video class="pdi3-v__vid" data-pdi3-vid muted loop playsinline preload="none" disableremoteplayback aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
            {%- if hv_hls -%}<source data-src="{{ hv_hls.url }}" type="application/x-mpegURL">{%- endif -%}
            {%- if hv_mp4 -%}<source data-src="{{ hv_mp4.url }}" type="video/mp4">{%- endif -%}
          </video>
          <span class="pdi3-real"><i></i>Echte opname</span>
          <figcaption class="pdi3-cap">
            <span class="pdi3-cap__t">{{ h_label }}{% if h_caption != blank %}, {{ h_caption }}{% endif %}</span>
            {%- if h_note != blank -%}<span class="pdi3-cap__s">{{ h_note | replace: 'Echte opname bij', 'Geplaatst bij' }}</span>{%- endif -%}
          </figcaption>
          <span class="pdi3-prog" aria-hidden="true"><b data-pdi3-prog></b></span>
        </figure>
        {%- if s.hero_img_2 != blank or s.hero_img_3 != blank -%}
          <div class="pdi3-side">
            {%- for img in (2..3) -%}
              {%- liquid
                if forloop.index == 1
                  assign si = s.hero_img_2
                else
                  assign si = s.hero_img_3
                endif
                assign st = h_steps[forloop.index] | split: '@'
              -%}
              {%- if si != blank -%}
                <button type="button" class="pdi3-side__b" data-pdi3-seek="{{ st[1] | default: 0 }}">
                  {{ si | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: widths: '300, 450, 600', sizes: '19vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: si.alt }}
                  <span>{{ st[0] }}</span>
                </button>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- if h_steps.size > 1 -%}
        <ol class="pdi3-steps" role="list">
          {%- for step in h_steps -%}
            {%- assign st = step | split: '@' -%}
            <li><button type="button" data-pdi3-seek="{{ st[1] | default: 0 }}"{% if forloop.first %} class="is-on"{% endif %}>{{ st[0] }}</button></li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ol>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="pdi3-act">
        <a class="pdi3-btn" href="{{ hp.url }}">Bekijk {{ h_label }}</a>
        {%- if h_v -%}
          <button type="button" class="pdi3-btn pdi3-btn--l" data-pc-sample data-id="{{ h_v.id }}" data-url="{{ hp.url }}" data-title="{{ hp.title | escape }}" data-label="{{ h_label | escape }}" data-img="{{ h_swatch | strip }}" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Staal van {{ h_label | escape }} toevoegen"><span class="off">+ Gratis staal</span><span class="on">✓ Staal gekozen</span></button>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <nav class="pdi3-chips pdi3-chips--m" aria-label="Per ruimte">
    {%- for r in rooms -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign i = forloop.index0
        assign guide_key = '|wandpanelen-' | append: r | append: '='
        assign link = insp_url | append: '?view=gids-' | append: r
        assign gu = '|' | append: guide_urls
        if gu contains guide_key
          assign link = gu | split: guide_key | last | split: '|' | first
        endif
        assign rp = all_products[room_p[i]]
        capture sw
          render 'pd-swatch', product: rp, width: 80
        endcapture
      -%}
      <a class="pdi3-chip" href="{{ link }}">{% if rp %}<img src="{{ sw | strip }}" alt="" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{{ room_name[i] }}</a>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </nav>

  {%- comment -%} Wanden van klanten: alleen echt beeld (blokken) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign n_wand = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'wand' | size -%}
  {%- if n_wand > 0 or request.design_mode -%}
  <section class="pdi-sec" aria-labelledby="pdi-wand">
    <div class="pdi-wrap pdi3-sechead">
      <div><p class="pdi-k">Echt geplaatst</p><h2 class="pdi-h2" id="pdi-wand">Wanden van klanten</h2></div>
      <a class="pdi3-lnk pdi3-lnk--d" href="https://www.instagram.com/puredeco.nl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Deel jouw wand: tag @puredeco.nl</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="pdi3-rail pdi3-rail--{{ n_wand | at_most: 4 }}" role="list" data-pdi3-rail>
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type == 'wand' -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign b = block.settings
            assign bp = b.product
            assign ba = nil
            if b.artikel != blank
              assign ba = blog.articles | where: 'handle', b.artikel | first
              unless ba
                assign bh = 'nieuws/' | append: b.artikel
                assign ba = blog.articles | where: 'handle', bh | first
              endunless
            endif
            capture b_code
              render 'pd-decor', product: bp, part: 'code'
            endcapture
            capture b_name
              render 'pd-decor', product: bp, part: 'name'
            endcapture
            assign b_label = b_code | strip | append: ' ' | append: b_name | strip
            assign b_img = b.image | default: ba.image
            if b.video
              assign bv_hls = b.video.sources | where: 'format', 'm3u8' | first
              assign bv_mp4 = b.video.sources | where: 'format', 'mp4' | sort: 'height' | last
            endif
            assign b_alt = b.title | append: ', ' | append: b_label | strip
          -%}
          <li class="pdi3-card" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <a class="pdi3-v pdi3-card__m" href="{% if ba %}{{ ba.url }}{% elsif bp %}{{ bp.url }}{% else %}#{% endif %}">
              {%- if b.video -%}
                {%- assign b_poster = b.image | default: b.video.preview_image -%}
                {{ b_poster | image_url: width: 720, height: 900, crop: 'center' | image_tag: widths: '360, 540, 720', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 24vw, 72vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: b.video.alt | default: b_alt, class: 'pdi3-v__poster' }}
                <video class="pdi3-v__vid" data-pdi3-lazy muted loop playsinline preload="none" disableremoteplayback aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
                  {%- if bv_hls -%}<source data-src="{{ bv_hls.url }}" type="application/x-mpegURL">{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if bv_mp4 -%}<source data-src="{{ bv_mp4.url }}" type="video/mp4">{%- endif -%}
                </video>
                <span class="pdi3-real"><i></i>Echte opname</span>
              {%- elsif b_img -%}
                {{ b_img | image_url: width: 720, height: 900, crop: 'center' | image_tag: widths: '360, 540, 720', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 24vw, 72vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: b_alt, class: 'pdi3-v__poster' }}
                <span class="pdi3-real pdi3-real--ph"><i></i>Echte foto</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="pdi3-cap"><span class="pdi3-cap__t">{{ b.title }}</span>{% if b.sub != blank %}<span class="pdi3-cap__s">{{ b.sub }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
            </a>
            <p class="pdi3-card__meta">
              {%- if bp -%}<a href="{{ bp.url }}"><strong>{{ b_label }}</strong></a>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if ba -%}<a href="{{ ba.url }}">Lees het project →</a>{%- elsif bp -%}<a href="{{ bp.url }}">Shop dit decor →</a>{%- endif -%}
            </p>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if request.design_mode -%}
        <li class="pdi3-card pdi3-card--add"><span>Voeg een blok "Wand van een klant" toe: video of foto, decor en tekst.</span></li>
      {%- endif -%}
    </ul>
    <p class="pdi-wrap pdi3-lnk--m"><a class="pdi3-lnk" href="https://www.instagram.com/puredeco.nl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jouw wand op deze pagina? Tag @puredeco.nl</a></p>
  </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Per ruimte (zonder renders: het echte decor als staal) {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pdi-sec pdi-wrap" aria-labelledby="pdi-rooms">
    <p class="pdi-k">Per ruimte</p>
    <h2 class="pdi-h2" id="pdi-rooms">Waar komt je wand?</h2>
    <ul class="pdi3-rooms" role="list">
      {%- for r in rooms -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign i = forloop.index0
          assign guide_key = '|wandpanelen-' | append: r | append: '='
          assign link = insp_url | append: '?view=gids-' | append: r
          assign gu = '|' | append: guide_urls
          if gu contains guide_key
            assign link = gu | split: guide_key | last | split: '|' | first
          endif
          assign rp = all_products[room_p[i]]
          capture sw
            render 'pd-swatch', product: rp, width: 240
          endcapture
          capture zoom
            render 'pd-swatch', product: rp, part: 'zoom'
          endcapture
        -%}
        <li><a href="{{ link }}" class="pdi3-room">
          <span class="pdi3-room__sw{% if zoom contains '1' %} is-zoom{% endif %}">{% if rp %}<img src="{{ sw | strip }}" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</span>
          <span><span class="pdi3-room__t">{{ room_name[i] }}</span><span class="pdi3-room__s">{{ room_sub[i] }}</span></span>
          <span class="pdi3-room__go" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          <span class="visually-hidden">{{ room_ttl[i] }}: lees de gids</span>
        </a></li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Per materiaal {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign mats = 'Hout|Japandi|Leer|Art|Naadloos 8 mm|Doorlopend marmer|Akupanelen|Alle wandpanelen' | split: '|'
    assign mat_c = 'hout-1,japandi,leer,kunst,8mm-naadloos,doorlopend-marmer,akupanelen,wandpanelen' | split: ','
    assign mat_p = '811-hout-walnut-classic,619-japanse-stof-japaneses-style-jade,646-leer-khaki-leather,842-art-stucco-light,wandpaneel-travertine-ivory-851,677-doorlopend-marmer-italian-white-slate,driezijdige-akupanelen,urban-smoke-692-marmerlook' | split: ','
  -%}
  <section class="pdi-sec" aria-labelledby="pdi-mat">
    <div class="pdi-wrap"><p class="pdi-k">Per materiaal</p><h2 class="pdi-h2" id="pdi-mat">Kies je uitstraling</h2></div>
    <ul class="pdi3-mats" role="list">
      {%- for m in mats -%}
        {%- assign mp = all_products[mat_p[forloop.index0]] -%}
        <li><a href="/collections/{{ mat_c[forloop.index0] }}">
          {%- if mp.featured_image == blank -%}
          {%- elsif mp.handle contains 'akupanelen' -%}
            {{ mp.featured_image | image_url: width: 400, height: 534, crop: 'center' | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '200, 400', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 12vw, 32vw', alt: '', class: 'pdi3-mat__img' }}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- capture msw -%}{%- render 'pd-swatch', product: mp, width: 400 -%}{%- endcapture -%}
            {%- capture mz -%}{%- render 'pd-swatch', product: mp, part: 'zoom' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
            <span class="pdi3-mat__sw{% if mz contains '1' %} is-zoom{% endif %}"><img src="{{ msw | strip }}" alt="" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="pdi3-mat__img"></span>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span>{{ m }} →</span>
        </a></li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Van paneel tot wand: echte montage- en buigvideo {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if s.how_video != blank or s.bend_video != blank -%}
  <section class="pdi-sec pdi-wrap pdi3-how" aria-labelledby="pdi-how">
    <div class="pdi3-how__t">
      <p class="pdi-k">Zelf plaatsen</p>
      <h2 class="pdi-h2" id="pdi-how">Van paneel tot wand</h2>
      <p class="pdi3-intro">{{ s.how_text | default: 'Op maat zagen, kit erop en plaatsen. Zonder stof en stucwerk.' }}</p>
      <p class="pdi3-links"><a class="pdi3-lnk" href="/pages/installatie">Montage stap voor stap</a>{% if s.pdf_url != blank %}<a class="pdi3-lnk" href="{{ s.pdf_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Handleiding (pdf)</a>{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="pdi3-how__m{% if s.how_image != blank %} has-3{% endif %}" role="list">
      {%- if s.how_image != blank -%}
        <li class="pdi3-how__x"><a class="pdi3-v" href="/pages/installatie">
          {{ s.how_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: widths: '300, 450, 600', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 17vw, 45vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: s.how_image.alt, class: 'pdi3-v__poster' }}
          <span class="pdi3-real"><i></i>Echte opname</span>
          <span class="pdi3-cap"><span class="pdi3-cap__t">Op maat zagen</span></span>
        </a></li>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- for vid in (1..2) -%}
        {%- liquid
          if forloop.index == 1
            assign hw = s.how_video
            assign hw_t = 'Plaatsen'
            assign hw_s = 'Meten · zagen · tegen de wand'
            assign hw_u = '/pages/installatie'
          else
            assign hw = s.bend_video
            assign hw_t = 'Ronde wand'
            assign hw_s = 'Infrezen · verwarmen · buigen'
            assign hw_u = gids_buig_url
          endif
        -%}
        {%- if hw != blank -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign hw_hls = hw.sources | where: 'format', 'm3u8' | first
            assign hw_mp4 = hw.sources | where: 'format', 'mp4' | sort: 'height' | last
          -%}
          <li><a class="pdi3-v" href="{{ hw_u }}">
            {{ hw.preview_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: widths: '300, 450, 600', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 17vw, 45vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: hw.alt, class: 'pdi3-v__poster' }}
            <video class="pdi3-v__vid" data-pdi3-lazy muted loop playsinline preload="none" disableremoteplayback aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
              {%- if hw_hls -%}<source data-src="{{ hw_hls.url }}" type="application/x-mpegURL">{%- endif -%}
              {%- if hw_mp4 -%}<source data-src="{{ hw_mp4.url }}" type="video/mp4">{%- endif -%}
            </video>
            <span class="pdi3-real"><i></i>Echte opname</span>
            <span class="pdi3-cap"><span class="pdi3-cap__t">{{ hw_t }}</span><span class="pdi3-cap__s">{{ hw_s }}</span></span>
          </a>
          {%- if forloop.index == 2 -%}<a class="pdi3-lnk pdi3-how__g" href="{{ gids_buig_url }}">Gids ronde wanden →</a>{%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Advies en projecten {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign advies = ''
    assign projs = ''
    for a in blog.articles limit: 50
      capture kind
        render 'pd-insp', key: a.handle, part: 'kind'
      endcapture
      capture o
        render 'pd-insp', key: a.handle, part: 'order'
      endcapture
      if kind == 'advies'
        assign advies = advies | append: o | append: ':' | append: a.handle | append: ','
      elsif kind == 'project'
        assign projs = projs | append: o | append: ':' | append: a.handle | append: ','
      endif
    endfor
    assign advies = advies | split: ',' | sort
    assign projs = projs | split: ',' | sort
  -%}
  <div class="pdi-sec pdi-wrap pdi3-two">
    <section aria-labelledby="pdi-adv">
      <p class="pdi-k">Advies</p>
      <h2 class="pdi-h2" id="pdi-adv">Goed om te weten</h2>
      <ol class="pdi-list pdi3-list" role="list">
        {%- assign n = 0 -%}
        {%- for entry in advies -%}
          {%- if forloop.index == 2 -%}
            {%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}
            <li><a href="{{ gids_bk_url }}"><span class="pdi-list__n">{{ n | prepend: '0' }}</span><span><span class="pdi-list__t">Wandpanelen in de badkamer</span><span class="pdi-list__s">Decors, Linea of Signature, kosten en plaatsen over tegels</span></span><span class="pdi-list__go">Lezen →</span></a></li>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- assign h = entry | split: ':' | last -%}
          {%- assign a = blog.articles | where: 'handle', h | first -%}
          {%- if a -%}
            {%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}
            <li><a href="{{ a.url }}"><span class="pdi-list__n">{{ n | prepend: '0' }}</span><span><span class="pdi-list__t">{% render 'pd-insp', key: h, part: 'ttl' %}</span><span class="pdi-list__s">{% render 'pd-insp', key: h, part: 'lead' %}</span></span><span class="pdi-list__go">Lezen →</span></a></li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- if advies.size < 2 -%}
          {%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}
          <li><a href="{{ gids_bk_url }}"><span class="pdi-list__n">{{ n | prepend: '0' }}</span><span><span class="pdi-list__t">Wandpanelen in de badkamer</span><span class="pdi-list__s">Decors, Linea of Signature, kosten en plaatsen over tegels</span></span><span class="pdi-list__go">Lezen →</span></a></li>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- assign n = n | plus: 1 -%}
        <li><a href="{{ gids_buig_url }}"><span class="pdi-list__n">{{ n | prepend: '0' }}</span><span><span class="pdi-list__t">Wandpanelen buigen voor ronde wanden</span><span class="pdi-list__s">Infrezen, verwarmen en buigen, met video</span></span><span class="pdi-list__go">Lezen →</span></a></li>
      </ol>
      {%- if projs.size > 0 -%}
        <p class="pdi-k pdi-k--stone pdi3-sub">Projecten</p>
        <ul class="pdi-list pdi3-list pdi3-list--p" role="list">
          {%- for entry in projs -%}
            {%- assign h = entry | split: ':' | last -%}
            {%- assign a = blog.articles | where: 'handle', h | first -%}
            {%- if a -%}
              <li><a href="{{ a.url }}"><span class="pdi-list__n">{% render 'pd-insp', key: h, part: 'room' %}</span><span><span class="pdi-list__t">{% render 'pd-insp', key: h, part: 'ttl' %}</span><span class="pdi-list__s">{% render 'pd-insp', key: h, part: 'lead' %}</span></span><span class="pdi-list__go">Lezen →</span></a></li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} Veelgestelde vragen (teksten uit de goedgekeurde collectie- en productteksten) {%- endcomment -%}
    <section aria-labelledby="pdi-faq">
      <p class="pdi-k">Veelgestelde vragen</p>
      <h2 class="pdi-h2" id="pdi-faq">Kort antwoord</h2>
      <div class="pdi-faq">
        <details><summary>Wat is het verschil tussen Linea en Signature?</summary><p>Linea is 5 mm: de panelen stuiten tegen elkaar en je ziet een naad, die je afwerkt met een tussenprofiel of kit in kleur. Signature is 8 mm met een kliksysteem; op een vlakke, rechte ondergrond is de naad vrijwel onzichtbaar.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Hoeveel panelen heb ik nodig voor mijn wand?</summary><p>Een paneel is 122 cm breed. Deel de breedte van je wand door 1,22 en rond naar boven af. Een wand van 4,50 m breed geeft 3,7: je hebt dus 4 panelen nodig. Op elke productpagina rekent de calculator het voor je uit.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Kan ik wandpanelen in de badkamer gebruiken?</summary><p>Ja. De panelen zijn waterbestendig en geschikt voor badkamer en keuken. Vermijd wel plekken waar water blijft staan.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Kan ik eerst een staal bekijken?</summary><p>Ja. Bestel tot vijf stalen gratis; je betaalt alleen € 6,95 verzending. Of bekijk de panelen op ware grootte in onze studio in Herwen.</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="pdi3-close">
    <div class="pdi-wrap pdi3-close__in">
      <div><p class="pdi-k">Eerst voelen</p><h2 class="pdi-h2">Tot 5 stalen gratis, alleen € 6,95 verzending</h2></div>
      <div class="pdi3-close__b"><a class="pdi3-btn pdi3-btn--w" href="/pages/sample">Bestel gratis stalen</a><a class="pdi3-btn pdi3-btn--o" href="/pages/showroom">Plan een bezoek aan de studio</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pc-toast pdi3-toast" data-pdi3-toast hidden role="status" aria-live="polite"><span data-pdi3-toast-t></span> <a href="/pages/sample">Bekijk je stalen →</a></div>
</div>

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.querySelector('[data-pdi3]');
    if (!root) return;
    var still = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

    /* Video's: bronnen pas laden als ze bijna in beeld zijn; HLS eerst (Safari), anders mp4 */
    function load(v) {
      if (v.dataset.on) return; v.dataset.on = '1';
      var canHls = v.canPlayType('application/vnd.apple.mpegurl') || v.canPlayType('application/x-mpegURL');
      [].forEach.call(v.querySelectorAll('source'), function (s) {
        if (/mpegurl/i.test(s.type) && !canHls) { s.remove(); return; }
        s.src = s.dataset.src;
      });
      v.load();
      v.addEventListener('playing', function () { v.parentNode.classList.add('is-on'); }, { once: true });
    }
    function play(v) { var p = v.play(); if (p && p.catch) p.catch(function () {}); }
    var vids = root.querySelectorAll('[data-pdi3-vid], [data-pdi3-lazy]');
    if (!still && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (es) {
        es.forEach(function (e) {
          var v = e.target;
          if (e.isIntersecting) { load(v); play(v); } else if (v.dataset.on) { v.pause(); }
        });
      }, { rootMargin: '200px 0px' });
      var hero = root.querySelector('[data-pdi3-vid]');
      var watch = function () { [].forEach.call(vids, function (v) { io.observe(v); }); };
      if (hero && document.readyState !== 'complete') window.addEventListener('load', watch, { once: true }); else watch();
    }

    /* Hero: stappen springen naar het moment in de video */
    var hv = root.querySelector('[data-pdi3-vid]'), prog = root.querySelector('[data-pdi3-prog]');
    var steps = [].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.pdi3-steps [data-pdi3-seek]'));
    if (hv) {
      root.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        var b = e.target.closest('[data-pdi3-seek]'); if (!b || still) return;
        load(hv); hv.currentTime = parseFloat(b.dataset.pdi3Seek) || 0; play(hv);
      });
      hv.addEventListener('timeupdate', function () {
        if (!hv.duration) return;
        if (prog) prog.style.width = (hv.currentTime / hv.duration * 100) + '%';
        var on = 0;
        steps.forEach(function (s, i) { if (hv.currentTime + 0.05 >= (parseFloat(s.dataset.pdi3Seek) || 0)) on = i; });
        steps.forEach(function (s, i) { s.classList.toggle('is-on', i === on); });
      });
    }

    /* Gratis staal (zelfde lijst als collectie en homepage) */
    var KEY = 'pd-edit', MAX = parseInt(root.dataset.max, 10) || 5;
    var toast = root.querySelector('[data-pdi3-toast]'), tt = root.querySelector('[data-pdi3-toast-t]'), timer;
    function get() { try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY) || '[]') || []; } catch (e) { return []; } }
    function put(v) { try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(v)); } catch (e) {} }
    function paint() {
      var c = get();
      [].forEach.call(root.querySelectorAll('[data-pc-sample]'), function (b) { var on = c.some(function (x) { return x.id === b.dataset.id; }); b.classList.toggle('is-on', on); b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false'); });
    }
    function say(t) { if (!toast) return; tt.textContent = t; toast.hidden = false; clearTimeout(timer); timer = setTimeout(function () { toast.hidden = true; }, 4000); }
    root.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var b = e.target.closest('[data-pc-sample]'); if (!b) return;
      var c = get(), i = c.findIndex(function (x) { return x.id === b.dataset.id; });
      if (i > -1) { c.splice(i, 1); put(c); paint(); say(b.dataset.label + ' verwijderd · ' + c.length + ' van ' + MAX + ' gekozen'); return; }
      if (c.length >= MAX) { say('Je hebt al ' + MAX + ' stalen gekozen'); return; }
      c.push({ id: b.dataset.id, url: b.dataset.url, title: b.dataset.title, label: b.dataset.label, img: b.dataset.img }); put(c); paint();
      say(b.dataset.label + ' toegevoegd · ' + c.length + ' van ' + MAX + ' gekozen');
    });
    paint();
  })();
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": {{ shop.url | append: '/' | json }} },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Inspiratie", "item": {{ shop.url | append: insp_url | json }} }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "CollectionPage",
      "name": {{ s.heading | default: 'Wandpanelen voor elke ruimte' | json }},
      "url": {{ shop.url | append: insp_url | json }},
      "inLanguage": "nl",
      "hasPart": [
        {%- assign first = true -%}
        {%- for a in blog.articles limit: 50 -%}
          {%- capture kind -%}{%- render 'pd-insp', key: a.handle, part: 'kind' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- if kind == 'project' or kind == 'advies' -%}
            {%- unless first %},{% endunless -%}
            {%- capture t -%}{%- render 'pd-insp', key: a.handle, part: 'ttl' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
            { "@type": "Article", "headline": {{ t | strip | json }}, "url": {{ shop.url | append: a.url | json }} }
            {%- assign first = false -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- for r in rooms -%}
          {%- assign guide_key = '|wandpanelen-' | append: r | append: '=' -%}
          {%- assign gu = '|' | append: guide_urls -%}
          {%- if gu contains guide_key -%}
            {%- unless first %},{% endunless -%}
            {%- assign gurl = gu | split: guide_key | last | split: '|' | first -%}
            { "@type": "Article", "headline": {{ room_ttl[forloop.index0] | json }}, "url": {{ shop.url | append: gurl | json }} }
            {%- assign first = false -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor %}
      ]
    },
    {%- comment -%} Echte video's op deze pagina {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if hv -%}
    {
      "@type": "VideoObject",
      "name": {{ 'Wandpaneel ' | append: h_label | append: ', ' | append: h_caption | json }},
      "description": {{ hv.alt | default: h_label | json }},
      "thumbnailUrl": {{ hv.preview_image | image_url: width: 1080 | prepend: 'https:' | json }},
      "uploadDate": {{ hp.metafields.puredeco.project_video_date.value | default: hp.updated_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' | json }},
      "duration": {{ hv.duration | divided_by: 1000 | prepend: 'PT' | append: 'S' | json }}{% if hv_mp4 %},
      "contentUrl": {{ hv_mp4.url | json }}{% endif %}
    },
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {%- if block.type == 'wand' and block.settings.video -%}
        {%- assign bv = block.settings.video -%}
        {%- assign bv_mp4 = bv.sources | where: 'format', 'mp4' | sort: 'height' | last -%}
    {
      "@type": "VideoObject",
      "name": {{ block.settings.title | json }},
      "description": {{ bv.alt | default: block.settings.title | json }},
      "thumbnailUrl": {{ bv.preview_image | image_url: width: 1080 | prepend: 'https:' | json }},
      "uploadDate": {{ block.settings.date | default: '2026-10-27' | json }},
      "duration": {{ bv.duration | divided_by: 1000 | prepend: 'PT' | append: 'S' | json }}{% if bv_mp4 %},
      "contentUrl": {{ bv_mp4.url | json }}{% endif %}
    },
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- for vid in (1..2) -%}
      {%- liquid
        if forloop.index == 1
          assign hw = s.how_video
        else
          assign hw = s.bend_video
        endif
      -%}
      {%- if hw != blank -%}
        {%- assign hw_mp4 = hw.sources | where: 'format', 'mp4' | sort: 'height' | last -%}
    {
      "@type": "VideoObject",
      "name": {% if forloop.index == 1 %}"Wandpanelen plaatsen: meten, zagen en tegen de wand"{% else %}"Wandpaneel buigen voor een ronde wand"{% endif %},
      "description": {{ hw.alt | json }},
      "thumbnailUrl": {{ hw.preview_image | image_url: width: 1080 | prepend: 'https:' | json }},
      "uploadDate": "2026-10-27",
      "duration": {{ hw.duration | divided_by: 1000 | prepend: 'PT' | append: 'S' | json }}{% if hw_mp4 %},
      "contentUrl": {{ hw_mp4.url | json }}{% endif %}
    },
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor %}
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Wat is het verschil tussen Linea en Signature?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Linea is 5 mm: de panelen stuiten tegen elkaar en je ziet een naad, die je afwerkt met een tussenprofiel of kit in kleur. Signature is 8 mm met een kliksysteem; op een vlakke, rechte ondergrond is de naad vrijwel onzichtbaar." } },
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Hoeveel panelen heb ik nodig voor mijn wand?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Een paneel is 122 cm breed. Deel de breedte van je wand door 1,22 en rond naar boven af. Een wand van 4,50 m breed geeft 3,7: je hebt dus 4 panelen nodig." } },
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Kan ik wandpanelen in de badkamer gebruiken?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Ja. De panelen zijn waterbestendig en geschikt voor badkamer en keuken. Vermijd wel plekken waar water blijft staan." } },
        { "@type": "Question", "name": "Kan ik eerst een staal bekijken?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Ja. Bestel tot vijf stalen gratis; je betaalt alleen € 6,95 verzending. Of bekijk de panelen op ware grootte in onze studio in Herwen." } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>

